# include

This directory is reserved for project-wide public headers.

It is currently intentionally empty. The converter code is organized as
PlatformIO private libraries under `lib/`, and each component keeps its own
headers next to its implementation. That makes ownership clearer and keeps
component dependencies explicit.

Use this directory only for headers that are genuinely shared by the whole
application and do not belong to a specific component. Most new declarations
should go into the relevant component directory under `lib/`.
